<title>CANADA: BCE Mobile Q4 share turns to loss.</title>
<headline>BCE Mobile Q4 share turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.23   profit	C$0.19</p>
<p> Net	   loss	16,100   profit	12,900</p>
<p> Revs		     262,200		  219,500</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.92   profit	C$0.74</p>
<p> Net	 profit	63,900   profit	51,000</p>
<p> Revs		     926,300		  781,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Included in fourth-quarter 1996 results was a special charge of C$48.1 million for the write-off of the unamortized balance of hardware costs associated with certain customer contracts at December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is BCE Mobile Communications Inc.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
